p received the same preparation of AI4 T-cells.</p></fn><fn id="t1fn2"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>Statistical analysis by &#x003c7;<sup>2</sup> test (vs. NOD recipients in the same experimental group).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>